    Phase 6 review: add regression coverage for position-based lesson routing, drop dead kind check

    LessonPage/CatchUpPage switched from lessonEntryByNumber to lessonEntryByPosition
    in this phase's diff to fix a real divergence (position and legacyNumber differ
    from position 15 on since task 4.3's resequence) — but nothing exercised it end
    to end. Added LessonPage.test.tsx pinning that a lesson past position 14 still
    resolves and renders its deck; verified it reproduces "Lesson not found" when
    reverted to the number-based lookup.

    Also simplified LessonIntro's now-always-true `content.kind === "deck"` check
    (the video arm it used to distinguish from is gone) to a plain boolean.

